{"text":"So you don't drink from the river. A few steps back from the bank, in the sand, you dig a pit and wait. Water seeps in through the sand. Slow. Muddy. But cleaner than the river, and far from the teeth. You fill the bottle. In the shallow pools, small fish are trapped. You catch three and dry them on a hot rock. No fire needed. It's warm here, almost tropical, even at night. From now on, every morning starts at the pools. The book says freshwater animals, turtles, frogs, even crocodiles, made it through far better than most. Rule two: stay near water.","alignment":{"characters":["S","o"," ","y","o","u"," ","d","o","n","'","t"," ","d","r","i","n","k"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r","."," ","A"," ","f","e","w"," ","s","t","e","p","s"," ","b","a","c","k"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","a","n","k",","," ","i","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","a","n","d",","," ","y","o","u"," ","d","i","g"," ","a"," ","p","i","t"," ","a","n","d"," ","w","a","i","t","."," ","W","a","t","e","r"," ","s","e","e","p","s"," ","i","n"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","a","n","d","."," ","S","l","o","w","."," ","M","u","d","d","y","."," ","B","u","t"," ","c","l","e","a","n","e","r"," ","t","h","a","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r",","," ","a","n","d"," ","f","a","r"," ","f","r","o","m"," ","t","h","e"," ","t","e","e","t","h","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","f","i","l","l"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","o","t","t","l","e","."," ","I","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","s","h","a","l","l","o","w"," ","p","o","o","l","s",","," ","s","m","a","l","l"," ","f","i","s","h"," ","a","r","e"," ","t","r","a","p","p","e","d","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","c","a","t","c","h"," ","t","h","r","e","e"," ","a","n","d"," ","d","r","y"," ","t","h","e","m"," ","o","n"," ","a"," ","h","o","t"," ","r","o","c","k","."," ","N","o"," ","f","i","r","e"," ","n","e","e","d","e","d","."," ","I","t","'","s"," ","w","a","r","m"," ","h","e","r","e",","," ","a","l","m","o","s","t"," 